PROJECT STRUCTURE
=================

The Julio project is organized into four technical pillars:

1. Google Flow (flow/)
   - Orchestration of AI workflows
   - Type: Workflow engine

2. Antigravedad (antigravedad/)
   - Agent layer implementation
   - Type: AI agent framework

3. NotebookLM (notebooklm/)
   - Reasoning engine
   - Type: Knowledge reasoning system

4. MCP (mcp/)
   - Repository isolation
   - Type: Data abstraction layer

